_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE648A80F0D38F4FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하지만 여전히 지켜보고만 있는 귀족들이 몇 있습니다... 혹시 그 사람들과도 이야기를 할 수 있게 여기로 데려와 주실 수 있습니까?","female":"하지만 여전히 지켜보고만 있는 귀족들이 몇 있습니다... 혹시 그 사람들과도 이야기를 할 수 있게 여기로 데려와 주실 수 있습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"171996","variant_female_record_index":"171997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234630.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234630","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423463001:0":{"text":"또 몇몇 분들이 자선 모금 행사장에 오셨습니다.","source_cn":"又有几位先生和女士来到了义捐现场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14033E964D8D2FD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423463002:0":{"text":"여러분의 선행이 더 많은 이들을 감동하게 하겠군요.","source_cn":"你们的善行一定会感动更多人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2567E7A6EB029F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234640.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234640","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234640","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423464001:1":{"text":"여러분, 라이소린 님께서 이번 모금에 소중한 마음을 전해 주셨습니다!","source_cn":"各位，莱索兰女士为本次募捐贡献了一份珍贵的善心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x223DFC86B1C1370B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423464002:1":{"text":"...모두가 알다시피, 나는 항상 평민들의 삶에 깊은 관심을 가지고 있었지. 이번 기회를 마련한 인듀어에게 고마울 따름이구나.","source_cn":"……大家都知道的，我一直十分关注平民的生活，感谢因度厄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58953BAAAA91AD81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423464003:1":{"text":"여러분도 모금에 관심이 있으십니까?","source_cn":"这几位先生和女士，也对义捐感兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDDF9E4ED47249B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423464004:1":{"text":"라이소린마저... 그러면 나도 내지.","source_cn":"连莱索兰都……那我也捐点吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D36A3C171161097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423464005:1":{"text":"여기까지 왔으니... 안 낼 수가 없겠어!","source_cn":"既然你们都把我弄过来了……我捐还不行嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE240F3A7FE4788F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423464006:1":{"text":"인듀어, 정말 능숙하네요! 대체 누구에게 배운 거예요?","source_cn":"因度厄还真是手段老练啊！这做事的风格，跟谁学的呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB9C297E4498F27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423464007:1":{"text":"일하면서 배운 것들이지요. 요즘은 사리에 님이 어려운 일을 많이 맡기셨기도 해서... 거기에 비하면 모금 정도는 일도 아닙니다.","source_cn":"是因为工作的磨砺吧，最近沙利叶分给了我不少困难的工作，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EEFB7057E10A60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423464008:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 도와주시지 않았다면 이렇게 좋은 결과를 내지는 못했을 겁니다.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A84C09915DFCD1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 도와주시지 않았다면 이렇게 좋은 결과를 내지는 못했을 겁니다.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 도와주시지 않았다면 이렇게 좋은 결과를 내지는 못했을 겁니다.","variant_male_record_index":"172009","variant_female_record_index":"172010","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423464009:1":{"text":"사리에 님의 부탁을 받고 오셨지요? 제가 대신 감사를 드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"我知道你们是受沙利叶所托，我代他向你们致以我们两人的谢意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894612AB65F38DC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱索兰":{"text":"라이소린","source":"莱索兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁观的贵族":{"text":"방관하는 귀족","source":"旁观的贵族","status":"matc